{
  "how_to_edit": [
    "Contracts posted on the tavern's bounty board. A bounty is completed by an expedition that returns alive (victory or retreat) having met its goal; rewards are paid on return.",
    "settings: slots (how many are posted at once; unlocks can add more), lasts_days (days before an unfinished bounty is taken down).",
    "text: {count}, {dungeon}, {time} and {class} are filled in from the goal.",
    "goal types: kills (family + min/max count, in one expedition), clear_time (clear a dungeon faster than the record x seconds_from_record, or default_seconds if there is no record yet), clear_class (clear as a class from the company), clear_no_potion, gold (bring home min-max gold).",
    "reward: gold, renown, essence; [low, high] picks a value in between."
  ],
  "settings": {
    "slots": 2,
    "lasts_days": 3
  },
